{"id":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_dorothy","label":"Dorothy · Nikke"},"label":"3. Your Grace,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_02","next":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01","speakers":{"dorothy":"Dorothy"},"icons":{"dorothy":"si_c233_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_1","text":"Your Grace,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_2","text":"did you send me something?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_3","text":"I did. Glad to see it got there okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_4","text":"Ah,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_5","text":"so it was from you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_6","text":"I was shocked to see a box with my name written on it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_7","text":"May I open it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_8","text":"Go ahead.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_9","text":"Just a moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_10","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_10","text":"After a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_11","text":"I opened it. It's a parasol.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_12","text":"With white lace trimming. Beautiful.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_13","text":"What possessed you to send this to me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_14","text":"Don't you like it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_15","text":"I like it very much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_16","text":"It's just a bit sudden, that's all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_17","text":"If you intend for this to be a bribe, it's a bit meager.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_18","text":"If you want to grease some palms, a parasol won't get you very far.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_19","text":"On the other hand, if it's just a gift, plain and simple, then what's the reason for sending it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_20","text":"It's just an ordinary gift. No more, no less.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_21","text":"A gift?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_22","text":"Why would you send me a gift out of the blue like this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_23","text":"I'm starting to think you're up to something.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_24","text":"Are you trying to get something from me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_25","text":"Is this some elaborate trick to make me appear foolish?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_26","text":"I just thought you'd appreciate it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_27","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_27","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_28","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_28","text":"There is no reply for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_29","text":"Let me get this straight.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_30","text":"You thought this parasol suited me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_31","text":"so you decided to give to me as a gift.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_32","text":"That's it, and that's all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_33","text":"Exactly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_34","text":"And you don't want anything","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_35","text":"in return?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_36","text":"Not at all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_37","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_38","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_39","text":"In that case...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_40","text":"I'll accept it gladly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_03_41","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_03_41","text":"For a while afterwards, there are no further messages from Dorothy.","jump":null}],"chat":true}